 basic Array.\r\n\r\nThe issue is described in detail here: \r\n- #108018\r\n\r\nIn short, in the [sentry-godot](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-godot) extension, we are passing Dictionary arguments to Android Plugin methods, and any basic arrays in a Dictionary are getting lost in the process. This PR fixes the issue by adding the conversion path for `Variant::ARRAY` in the `_variant_to_jvalue()` function inside `jni_utils.cpp`.\r\n\r\n### Before this PR\r\n<img width=\"506\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-26 at 16 34 22\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ecb6778-302a-43d8-b6bc-40d1c7beb474\" />\r\n\r\n### After this PR\r\n<img width=\"501\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-26 at 16 34 12\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b70eb7ed-89e6-4b30-8d83-3e7c65d17c93\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/g